@host = http://localhost:5112
@baseUrl = {{host}}/api/v1

### ============================================================
### Módulo 1 - Customer (fh.api.customer)
### Colección de endpoints, peticiones exitosas y errores de dominio.
### Variables de entorno: FH_API_BASE_URL y FH_API_TOKEN
### ============================================================

@customerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@identificationType = CC
@identificationNumber = 1010101010

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### SALUD
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Endpoint de salud del microservicio
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### POST /api/v1/customers  (HU-CUS-01 / HU-CUS-02)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Registrar cliente persona natural (B2C) - 201 Created
# @name createIndividualCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerType": "Individual",
  "name": "Ana María Gómez",
  "identificationType": "CC",
  "identificationNumber": "1010101010",
  "email": "ana.gomez@correo.com",
  "phone": "3001234567",
  "address": "Calle 100 #20-30, Bogotá"
}

### 2.2 Registrar cliente corporativo (B2B) - 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerType": "Corporate",
  "name": "Funeraria Del Norte Ltda",
  "identificationType": "NIT",
  "identificationNumber": "900123456",
  "email": "contacto@funerarianorte.com",
  "phone": "6015554444",
  "address": "Av. Reina #45-10, Bogotá"
}

### 2.3 ERROR 409 - La pareja (tipo, número) de identificación ya existe  [RN-03]
# Ejecutar de nuevo la petición 2.1 con el mismo CC y número.
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerType": "Individual",
  "name": "Ana Gómez Duplicada",
  "identificationType": "CC",
  "identificationNumber": "1010101010"
}

### 2.4 ERROR 400 - Nombre del titular vacío  [RN-01]
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerType": "Individual",
  "name": "   ",
  "identificationType": "CC",
  "identificationNumber": "2020202020"
}

### 2.5 ERROR 400 - Falta el tipo de identificación  [RN-02]
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerType": "Individual",
  "name": "Carlos Ramírez",
  "identificationType": "",
  "identificationNumber": "3030303030"
}

### 2.6 ERROR 400 - Falta el número de identificación  [RN-02]
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerType": "Individual",
  "name": "Carlos Ramírez",
  "identificationType": "CC",
  "identificationNumber": "   "
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### GET /api/v1/customers  (listado con filtro opcional)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Listar todos los clientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Listar solo los clientes suspendidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers?status=Suspended
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### GET /api/v1/customers/by-identification  (HU-CUS-03)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Consultar cliente por documento - 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/by-identification?type=CC&number=1010101010
Accept: application/json

### 4.2 La consulta normaliza el documento: sirve en minúsculas y con espacios
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/by-identification?type=cc&number=%20%201010101010
Accept: application/json

### 4.3 ERROR 400 - Falta el parámetro number  [RN-08]
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/by-identification?type=CC
Accept: application/json

### 4.4 ERROR 404 - Documento no registrado
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/by-identification?type=CC&number=9999999999
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### GET /api/v1/customers/{id}  (HU-CUS-03)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Consultar ficha por UUID - 200 OK
# Copiar el id devuelto por la petición 2.1
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Accept: application/json

### 5.2 ERROR 404 - UUID inexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT /api/v1/customers/{id}  (HU-CUS-04)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Actualizar datos de contacto y dirección - 200 OK
# La identificación NO se envía: es inmutable por diseño  [RN-05]
PUT {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana María Gómez de la Torre",
  "email": "anamaria.gomez@correo.com",
  "phone": "3019876543",
  "address": "Cra. 70 #5-20, Bogotá"
}

### 6.2 ERROR 400 - Nombre vacío en la actualización  [RN-04]
PUT {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "  "
}

### 6.3 ERROR 404 - UUID inexistente
PUT {{baseUrl}}/customers/11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana María Gómez"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### PATCH /api/v1/customers/{id}/status  (HU-CUS-05)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 Suspender al titular - 204 No Content
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Suspended"
}

### 7.2 Reactivar un titular suspendido - 204 No Content
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Active"
}

### 7.3 Desactivar al titular - 204 No Content
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Inactive"
}

### 7.4 Idempotencia: pedir el estado actual responde 204 sin escribir  [RN-06]
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Inactive"
}

### 7.5 ERROR 409 - Inactive es terminal, no admite reapertura  [RN-07]
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Active"
}

### 7.6 ERROR 404 - UUID inexistente
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/customers/11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Suspended"
}
